    "blasmophet_levia_consumed": {
      "id": "blasmophet_levia_consumed",
      "name_zh": "布拉兹莫菲特·被吞噬的莱维娅",
      "name_en": "Blasmophet, Levia Consumed",
      "type_zh": "暗影 Demi·英雄·Demon",
      "type_en": "",
      "text_zh": "传奇莱维娅专精\n当此牌在你物品栏中时，当血债将你的生命减至13时，你可以转化为布拉兹莫菲特·被吞噬的莱维娅。\n每回合一次，你可以从你的放逐区使用一张具有血债的牌。每当一张牌被置入你的放逐区时，将其翻为牌面朝下。若你将因血债失去生命，改为放逐牌库顶的一张牌。",
      "text_en": "Legendary Levia Specialization\nWhile this is in your inventory, when blood debt reduces your {h} to 13, you may transform into Blasmophet, Levia Consumed.\nOnce each turn, you may play a card with blood debt from your banished zone. Whenever a card is put into your banished zone, turn it face-down. If you would lose {h} from blood debt, instead banish the top card of the deck.",
      "source": "https://cards.fabtcg.com/card/blasmophet_levia_consumed/",
      "status": "machine-draft",
      "keywords": [
        "Legendary",
        "Transform"
      ],
      "variants": {
        "default": {
          "pitch": null,
          "cost": null,
          "power": null,
