      "text_zh": "你可以从你的放逐区使用此牌。若如此做，它进入竞技场时带有一个末日指示物。\n在你的回合开始时，除非你从此牌上移除一个末日指示物，否则摧毁它。\n若一位英雄将在行动阶段期间抽牌，改为该英雄放逐其牌库顶的一张牌，且本回合可以使用它。\n血债",
      "text_en": "You may play this from your banished zone. If you do, it enters the arena with a doom counter.\nAt the start of your turn, destroy this unless you remove a doom counter from it.\nIf a hero would draw a card during an action phase, instead they banish the top card of their deck and may play it this turn.\nBlood Debt",
      "source": "https://cards.fabtcg.com/card/chains_of_mephetis/",
      "status": "machine-draft",
      "keywords": [
        "Blood Debt"
      ],
      "variants": {
